title: "FIRST WORD: An Agent-Directed Production Pipeline for a One-Minute Film"
abstract: "The complete record, except the media, of a 60-second, 98-shot film produced by a single AI agent under human direction: the pipeline, the edit as data, the persona prompt, the plan, the reference studies, the rights records, the cost ledger and a production log with a failure analysis."
